    <section class="distil-section">
      <h2><span class="num">06</span> The wave32 occupancy table</h2>
      <p>
        WMMA-fused GEMMs are register-hungry. The 8-float accumulator alone
        costs 8 VGPRs/lane; with tile-staging and A/B register tiles you
        quickly land in the 80&ndash;120 VGPR range. That has to fit the
        wave32 occupancy curve &mdash; drag the slider:
      </p>

